WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.350
Ask a calculator for the inverse sine
of nought point five: thirty degrees.

2
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.340
Job done?

3
00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:10.140
Draw y equals sine x, from nought degrees.

4
00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:15.020
Add the line y equals nought point five,
and stretch the axis out to seven hundred

5
00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:16.620
and twenty degrees.

6
00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:18.970
So how many solutions are there?

7
00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:20.800
Just the calculator's one?

8
00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:21.700
Two?

9
00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:24.830
In this mission, you'll
define sine for any angle,

10
00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:27.380
with a point moving round the unit circle.

11
00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:30.520
You'll sketch the sine,
cosine and tangent graphs,

12
00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:32.550
and learn exact values.

13
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:37.050
And you'll solve trig equations,
including quadratics in cos x.

14
00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:41.970
Your mission: find how many solutions
sine x equals nought point five has,

15
00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:44.670
from nought to seven
hundred and twenty degrees.
